25:["$","p",null,{"children":["If your eviction snapshot says ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"\"of unlimited\""}],", no size-based eviction is\nconfigured, and this incident was inevitable. ",["$","code",null,{"children":"eviction_policy"}]," is an\n",["$","code",null,{"children":"Option"}]," on the filesystem store, and every field in it defaults to ",["$","code",null,{"children":"0"}],", which\nmeans ",["$","em",null,{"children":"never evict"}],". The config's own doc comment is blunt about it: failure to\nset this value causes items to never be removed."]}]
